<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>ReceptionistMatch: find the AI or live receptionist that fits your business</title>
<meta name="description" content="Independent guides to AI receptionists and live answering services for local businesses. Ranked by fit, never by commission. Prices sourced and dated. Launching soon.">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://receptionistmatch.com/">
<meta property="og:title" content="ReceptionistMatch">
<meta property="og:description" content="Find the AI or live receptionist that fits your business. Ranked by fit, never by commission.">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://receptionistmatch.com/">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0E1726">
<link rel="icon" href="favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script type="application/ld+json">
{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"ReceptionistMatch","url":"https://receptionistmatch.com/","email":"hello@receptionistmatch.com"}
</script>
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#0E1726; --paper:#F6F4EF; --card:#FFFFFF; --coral:#E8613C;
    --slate:#5B6577; --line:#E3DFD6; --soft:#EFEBE3;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  html{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
  body{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:400 17px/1.6 Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
  a{color:inherit}
  .wrap{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
  header{padding:28px 0}
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:-.01em;text-decoration:none}
  .mark{width:30px;height:30px}
  .hero{padding:64px 0 72px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .75fr;gap:56px;align-items:center}
  .eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--slate)}
  .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--coral);box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(232,97,60,.18);animation:pulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite}
  @keyframes pulse{50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 8px rgba(232,97,60,.06)}}
  h1{font-family:Fraunces,Georgia,serif;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(40px,6vw,66px);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:18px 0 22px}
  h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--coral)}
  .lede{font-size:19px;color:#2C3546;max-width:560px}
  .cta{margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;align-items:center}
  .btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:10px;transition:transform .15s ease,background .15s ease}
  .btn:hover{background:#1B2940;transform:translateY(-1px)}
  .note{font-size:14px;color:var(--slate)}
  .panel{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(14,23,38,.55)}
  .panel h2{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#AEB7C7;margin-bottom:18px}
  .q{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);font-size:15px}
  .q:first-of-type{border-top:0}
  .q span:last-child{color:#AEB7C7;text-align:right}
  .panel .foot{margin-top:18px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);font-size:14px;color:#D6DCE6}
  .panel .foot b{color:var(--coral);font-weight:600}
  section.method{padding:72px 0 80px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .method h2{font-family:Fraunces,Georgia,serif;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(28px,3.6vw,38px);letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.15}
  .method .sub{color:var(--slate);margin-top:10px;max-width:620px}
  .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:36px}
  .item{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:26px}
  .num{font-family:Fraunces,Georgia,serif;font-size:15px;color:var(--coral);font-weight:600}
  .item h3{font-size:18px;font-weight:600;margin:6px 0 8px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .item p{color:#3A4456;font-size:16px}
  .contact{padding:56px 0 64px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px}
  .contact h2{font-family:Fraunces,Georgia,serif;font-weight:600;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.015em}
  .contact p{color:var(--slate);margin-top:4px}
  .mail{font-weight:600;font-size:18px;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:2px solid var(--coral);padding-bottom:2px}
  footer{padding:26px 0 40px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14px;color:var(--slate)}
  @media (max-width:820px){
    .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px;padding:36px 0 56px}
    .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.dot{animation:none}.btn{transition:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="ReceptionistMatch home">
        <svg class="mark" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="32" height="32" rx="8" fill="#0E1726"/><path d="M10.2 9.5c.9-.9 2.3-.9 3.1 0l1.6 1.7c.7.7.8 1.9.1 2.7l-.9 1c.9 1.8 2.3 3.2 4.1 4.1l1-.9c.8-.7 2-.6 2.7.1l1.7 1.6c.9.8.9 2.2 0 3.1l-.8.8c-1.2 1.2-3.1 1.5-4.6.7-3.6-1.9-6.5-4.8-8.4-8.4-.8-1.5-.5-3.4.7-4.6z" fill="#F6F4EF"/><circle cx="23" cy="9" r="3" fill="#E8613C"/></svg>
        ReceptionistMatch
      </a>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>Launching soon</span>
          <h1>Find the AI or live receptionist that <em>fits your business.</em></h1>
          <p class="lede">Plain-English guides to AI receptionists and answering services for local businesses: what each one does, what it really costs, and which kind of business it suits.</p>
          <div class="cta">
            <a class="btn" href="mailto:hello@receptionistmatch.com">hello@receptionistmatch.com</a>
            <span class="note">Questions, tips or corrections welcome.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="panel" aria-label="What we match on">
          <h2>What we match on</h2>
          <div class="q"><span>Your trade</span><span>HVAC, dental, legal, salon…</span></div>
          <div class="q"><span>Calls a month</span><span>A few dozen to thousands</span></div>
          <div class="q"><span>Hours covered</span><span>After hours or 24/7</span></div>
          <div class="q"><span>AI or live people</span><span>Or a mix of both</span></div>
          <div class="q"><span>Budget</span><span>Real monthly cost</span></div>
          <p class="foot">Ranked by <b>fit</b>. Never by commission.</p>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="method" aria-labelledby="how">
        <h2 id="how">How we match</h2>
        <p class="sub">Some vendors pay us when you sign up. Here is how we keep that from deciding what you read.</p>
        <div class="grid">
          <div class="item"><div class="num">01</div><h3>Ranked by fit, never by commission</h3><p>We rank on your trade, your call volume, the hours you need covered and your budget. What a vendor pays us never moves a ranking.</p></div>
          <div class="item"><div class="num">02</div><h3>Payouts disclosed</h3><p>Every page says which vendors pay us and how, before the first link. Services that pay us nothing still get listed when they fit.</p></div>
          <div class="item"><div class="num">03</div><h3>Prices from the source, dated</h3><p>Every price links to the vendor's own pricing page and shows the date we checked it. When a price changes, the page changes.</p></div>
          <div class="item"><div class="num">04</div><h3>No pretend testing</h3><p>We tell you what we read and verified. We will not claim we tested a service unless we really did.</p></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="contact" aria-labelledby="contact">
        <div>
          <h2 id="contact">Get in touch</h2>
          <p>Business owners, vendors and partners: one inbox, read by a person.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="mail" href="mailto:hello@receptionistmatch.com">hello@receptionistmatch.com</a>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>© 2026 ReceptionistMatch. Independent guides for local businesses.</footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
